 gap-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 decoration-1 cursor-pointer text-roots-text\">Read Case Study</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-roots-text\">›</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\" py-16 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-[var(--roots-text)] mb-8\"><span style=\"color:#FF383C\">Engineering real change,</span> <!-- -->rooted in measurable impact.</h2><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-8\"><button style=\"border-color:var(--roots-agriculture);background-color:var(--roots-agriculture);color:#f8f2eb\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Agriculture and Environment</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Sports and Physical Literacy</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Education and Career Readiness</button><button style=\"border-color:#d1d5db;background-color:#f8f2eb;color:#374151\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-sm border text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 cursor-pointer\">Skill and Community Development</button></div><div style=\"border-color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"w-full border-2 rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 bg-[var(--roots-beige)] transition-colors duration-500 text-left\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between h-full\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6 transition-colors duration-500\">Agriculture and Environment</h3><div><p style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-1 transition-colors duration-500\">10,00,000 +</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[var(--roots-text)]\">Farmers trained in good practices</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-[var(--roots-text)] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">We work with farmers and rural communities to design and implement sustainable agricultural practices that address local challenges. Our initiatives focus on improving productivity, managing natural resources, and supporting climate aware solutions that ensure long term resilience.</p><div class=\"relative w-full h-[130px] sm:h-[150px] md:h-[170px] rounded-md overflow-hidden mb-3\"><img alt=\"Agriculture and Environment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fagri.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><a style=\"color:var(--roots-agriculture)\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold hover:underline transition-colors duration-500 w-fit\" href=\"/impact/agriculture\">Read More <span>›</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] py-10 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-roots-text mb-12\">Partner with us to co-create measurable impact</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative h-[400px] md:h-[450px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-end text-left group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 select-none\"><img alt=\"The Catalyst / Fulcrum\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, 30vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/55 to-black/20\"></div><div class=\"relative p-6 sm:p-8 z-10 text-white\"><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold mb-1 tracking-tight\">The Catalyst / Fulcrum</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-roots-education uppercase tracking-widest mb-3\">Strategic CSR co-investors</p><p class=\"text-sm text-white/80 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Co-investing with us — working together with communities to support and scale programs that build long-term impact and drive tran