"><img src=\"/companylogos/cl21.svg\" alt=\"Partner Logo 42\" class=\"h-20 w-auto max-w-[130px] object-contain duration-300 filter \"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-roots-beige py-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-10 \"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-regular text-roots-text\">Awards &amp; Recognitions</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><img alt=\"AwardBadge\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/award/AwardBadge.svg\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-roots-text tracking-tight\">2021</p><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold font-roots-text mb-1\">Best NGO Award</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 font-medium\">INDIA</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><img alt=\"AwardBadge\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/award/AwardBadge.svg\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-roots-text tracking-tight\">2022</p><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold font-roots-text mb-1\">Global Award</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 font-medium\">INDIA</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><img alt=\"AwardBadge\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/award/AwardBadge.svg\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-roots-text tracking-tight\">2024</p><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold font-roots-text mb-1\">CSR Award</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 font-medium\">INDIA</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"relative w-28 h-28 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><img alt=\"AwardBadge\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/award/AwardBadge.svg\"/></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-roots-text tracking-tight\">2025</p><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold font-roots-text mb-1\">NGO of the Year Award</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A4749]/80 font-medium\">INDIA</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#faf1ec] py-10 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><p class=\"text-2xl font-medium text-roots-text mb-2\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"text-sm font-light text-roots-text\">What our partners and communities say about us</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto gap-6 md:gap-8 items-stretch\"><div class=\"relative md:col-span-4 h-72 sm:h-96 md:h-auto overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Sania Nehwal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-top\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhome%2Fsania.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"md:col-span-8 bg-[#FEF9F1] flex flex-col justify-center text-left p-6 md:p-10\"><p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-roots-text leading-relaxed mb-8\">I would like to extend my heartfelt gratitude to Roots Foundation and Hyundai for initiating the<!-- --> <span class=\"text-orange-500 font-medium\">Sports Lab program</span>. This initiative demonstrates a keen understanding of the needs of sportspersons, providing them with essential resources such as this fitness centre in Hisar. By addressing these needs, they ensure that athletes can focus solely on their sports without any hindrances.</p><div><h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#1a1a1a]\">Sania Nehwal</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text/70 mt-1\">Indian Badminton Player and Olympic Medalist</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#FEF9F1] py-20 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-roots-primary fill-roots-primary\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.32 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.79M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-roots-text\">LinkedIn Posts</h2></div><p class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749]/70 mb-12\">Latest updates and insights from our youth and work on the ground.</p><div class=\"flex gap-6 overflow-x-auto pb-6 scrollbar-thin md:grid md:grid-cols-5 md:overflow-x-visible md:pb-0 mb-12\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[260px] md:w-auto bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200/80 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between h-[380px] md:h-[410px] text-left hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"relative h-44 w-full select-none\"><img alt=\"Post update image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 260px, 18vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-2.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm text-[10px] font-medium text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">2d ago</span></div><div class=\"p-4 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-roots-text leading-relaxed font-normal line-clamp-4\">Thrilled to witness the final match of the Roots Football Cup! Nurturing young talent and physical literacy in grassroots communities.</p><div class=\"border-t border-gray-100 pt-3 mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-gray-500 text-xs font-semibold\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-roots-primary cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-thumbs-up w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z\"></path><path d=\"M7 10v12\"></path></svg><span>342</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-roots-primary cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg><span>18</span></div><div class=\"hover:text-roots-primary cursor-pointer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2 w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"></circle><line x1=\"8.59\" x2=\"15.42\" y1=\"13.51\" y2=\"17.49\"></line><line x1=\"15.41\" x2=\"8.59\" y1=\"6.51\" y2=\"10.49\"></line></svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-[260px] md:w-auto bg-white rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200/80 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between h-[380px] md:h-[410px] text-left hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\"><div class=\"relative h-44 w-full select-none\"><img alt=\"Post update image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 260px, 18vw\" srcSet